### 4.2 CSS calc() Standards Compliance (CSS Values Level 4) ✅ COMPLETE
- [x] IEEE-754 semantics
  - [x] Division by zero returns ±∞ instead of throwing
  - [x] NaN propagation
  - [x] Infinity handling (+∞, -∞)
  - [x] Signed zero handling (0⁺, 0⁻)
- [x] Numeric constants support
  - [x] e (≈2.718)
  - [x] pi (≈3.14159)
  - [x] infinity keyword
  - [x] -infinity keyword
  - [x] NaN keyword
- [x] Additional math functions
  - [x] Trigonometric: sin(), cos(), tan(), asin(), acos(), atan(), atan2()
  - [x] Exponential: pow(), sqrt(), hypot(), log(), exp()
  - [x] Sign-related: abs(), sign()
  - [x] Stepped value: round(), mod(), rem()
- [x] clamp() enhancements
  - [x] Support 'none' keyword (clamp(none, VAL, MAX) = min(VAL, MAX))
- [ ] Formal calculation tree representation (future enhancement)
  - [ ] Sum/Product/Negate/Invert nodes (per spec)
  - [ ] Simplification algorithm
  - [ ] Proper serialization

